    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, so you're the Arisen of a foreign land. I am\r\nEtna. Now, there's aught I'd ask of you—",
        "Jp" : "ああ、あんたが異国の覚者様だったのね！\r\nあたしはエトナよ\r\nねぇ、ひとつお願いしたいことがあるんだけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516373,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The earth has been rumbling fiercely of late. Yet\r\nall anyone does is tremble at idle speculation —\r\n\"The Tarasque approaches,\" they whisper.",
        "Jp" : "最近この辺り、地鳴りがすごいのよ\r\nなのに、みんな「タラスクが来るんじゃないか」\r\nなんて憶測で怖がるばかり"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544689,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "At a time like this, one ought to scour the\r\narchives for any similar precedent.\r\nWould you not agree?!",
        "Jp" : "こんな時こそ、過去の記録をあらって\r\n似たような事件がなかったか\r\n確かめるべきだと思わない！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544690,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That is why I would go to the <SPOT 919>, where\r\naged texts lie—yet none will accompany me, for\r\nthe place swarms with beasts—",
        "Jp" : "だから昔の本がある《<SPOT 919>》に\r\n行きたいのに、あそこはもう獣だらけだからって\r\n誰も相手にしてくれないのよ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544691,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Even braving a trifle of peril, the tomes of old\r\nmust hold worth beyond it—most especially in\r\ntimes such as these—",
        "Jp" : "ちょっとくらい危険を冒しても\r\n過去の本にはそれ以上の価値があるはずなの――\r\n特に、こんな時には――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544692,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So. A Beastlord dwells at <SPOT 919> — 'tis why\r\nthe beasts muster there, or so I've heard. Should\r\nyou, Ser Arisen, strike it down... the beasts\r\nshall surely disperse—",
        "Jp" : "でね、《<SPOT 919>》には\"獣の主\"がいて\r\nそのせいで獣たちが集まってるって聞いたわ\r\n覚者様が\"獣の主\"を倒してくれたら\r\nきっと獣たちも散るはず――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544693,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I beseech you—\r\nI have absolute need of those aged texts.\r\nGo forth and slay the Beastlord!",
        "Jp" : "お願い――\r\n過去の本がどうしても必要なの\r\n\"獣の主\"を倒してきて！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544694,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
